<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AIDA STILL IN TALKS, ADVISES CAUTION.</title>
<headline>AIDA STILL IN TALKS, ADVISES CAUTION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aida Holdings Ltd on Wednesday advised shareholders that negotiations are still in progress which, if successfully concluded, may have an effect on the share price of the company.</p>
<p>It accordingly advised shareholders to continue exercising caution in their dealings in Aida ordinary shares, until a further announcement.</p>
<p>Aida issued an earlier cautionary announcement on June 13.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
